            "description": "# Simple Regular Expressions\n\nSrex simplifies regular expression usage with readable functionality.\n\n```python\nimport srex\nid_srex = srex.exactly('id: ').and_(rex.digits.repeat(5).group_as('id'))\nprint(id_srex.find('id: 12345').group('id'))  # prints '12345'\n```\n\n# Installation\n\n```bash\npip install srex\n```\n\n# Thanks\n\nProject influenced by [magic-regexp](https://github.com/danielroe/magic-regexp).\n",
